{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48843","headline":"六叹 一 · 李涉","name":"六叹 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蓬莱岛边采珠客，西望人寰星汉隔。\n千重叠浪耸云高，万里平沙连月白。\n海中洞穴寻难极，水底鲛人半相识。\n玄蚌初开影暂明，骊龙欲近威难逼。\n辛苦风涛白首期，得珠却恨求珠时。\n隋侯殁世几千载，只今薄俗空嗤嗤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李涉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48843.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48843","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}